Feature: slice-2 / nextjs-scaffold
Branch: feat/web-app-slice-2
Commit-target: pending (will land with brand tokens + scaffold)
Verified: 2026-05-27

What was built
==============
- `marketing-site/` scaffolded via `pnpm dlx create-next-app@latest`:
    Next.js 16.2.6, React 19.2.4, Tailwind 4.3.0, TypeScript 5.9.3,
    App Router, src/ dir, ESLint, pnpm, no turbopack/rspack flags
    (defaults to Turbopack in 16.x).
- Brand tokens ported from `flutter-app/superwizor/lib/theme/
  euphire_theme.dart` into `src/app/globals.css` via Tailwind 4
  CSS-first config (@theme block):
    ember/evergreen/nocturne/obsidian/frost/mist/aurora/magma + derived
    surfaces + radius/shadow/tracking tokens.
- Fonts wired via `next/font/google` in `src/app/layout.tsx`:
    Montserrat (display + body), Merriweather (serif marketing reads),
    Roboto Mono (technical labels). All with latin-ext subset for
    Polish diacritics.
- Root layout: lang="pl", Polish meta (title template, og:locale=pl_PL,
  description). Gradient background (Evergreen → Nocturne) on body.
- `src/app/page.tsx`: branded scaffold placeholder demonstrating every
  token category — overline + display heading + body serif + Ember CTA
  with glow shadow + outline secondary CTA + bottom marker. Responsive
  at mobile/tablet/desktop breakpoints (text-3xl → text-5xl → text-6xl).
- `scripts/snap.mjs`: puppeteer-based screenshot helper reused by every
  Slice 2 feature. Captures mobile (375x812 @2x, isMobile), tablet
  (768x1024 @2x, isMobile), desktop (1280x800 @1x).

How verified
============
1. `pnpm build` in marketing-site/ — exit 0, "Compiled successfully in
   3.9s", "Generating static pages 4/4" green.
2. `pnpm dev` started via Preview MCP (bash wrapper to force node@20
   PATH) — no console errors, no compile errors.
3. `curl http://localhost:3000/` saved to `home.html` — Polish strings
   present (Drugi mózg, superwizora, sesję, transkrypcję, terapeutów),
   brand classes applied (text-ember, text-frost, bg-ember,
   font-display, rounded-button), meta tags present (og:locale=pl_PL,
   title "Superwizor AI — drugi mózg superwizora").
4. Puppeteer screenshots at three breakpoints (`home-mobile.png`,
   `home-tablet.png`, `home-desktop.png`) — opened with Read tool,
   visually confirmed:
    - Mobile: heading wraps to 2 lines, body wraps to 3 lines, both
      CTAs stack full-width, bottom marker wraps to 2 lines, no
      horizontal overflow.
    - Tablet: 5xl heading on 2 lines, body on 2 lines, CTAs inline,
      marker fits.
    - Desktop: balanced hero composition, marker fits inline.
5. Brand fidelity check (vs euphire_theme.dart):
    - Ember #FCAE2F → matches CTA fill ✓
    - Evergreen #004D54 → top of gradient ✓
    - Nocturne #002E32 → bottom of gradient ✓
    - Frost #FAFAFA → display heading text ✓
    - Mist #B2CACC → body + overline + marker text ✓
    - Roboto Mono uppercase tracking on labels ✓
    - Ember Glow shadow (12px blur, 30% alpha) on primary CTA ✓

Known gaps (deferred to later Slice 2 features)
================================================
- No i18n yet — Polish is hard-coded in `layout.tsx` metadata and
  `page.tsx` strings. Feature 2 (next-intl-pl-en) will move all strings
  through translation keys and add the [locale] segment.
- No Connect-RPC client yet — feature 3.
- No Firebase Auth yet — feature 4.
- Scaffold page.tsx is a placeholder; real landing comes in feature 5.
- Next.js dev indicator (the "N" badge bottom-left) is visible in
  screenshots but is a dev-only overlay; doesn't ship to prod build.

Toolchain footnotes
===================
- `marketing-site/AGENTS.md` warns "This is NOT the Next.js you know"
  — relevant docs are in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/01-app/`.
- Preview MCP launch.json lives at `/Users/dpiotrak/supervisorai_v2/
  .claude/launch.json` (one dir above the project root). The
  runtimeExecutable uses `/bin/bash -lc` to force node@20 + pnpm into
  PATH — direct calls to /usr/local/bin/pnpm hit the corepack shim
  that fails on Node 20.
- puppeteer's Chromium download landed in
  `~/.cache/puppeteer/chrome/`; total ~190MB. scripts/node_modules is
  gitignored.

